<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαστ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, or
		parox. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐάστης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐάζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who cries</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐαί</span>, <i>a Bacchanal</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				54.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. θεός,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βάκχος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ath.Mitt.</u>
				27.94
			</span></i> (Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ εὐ. θρίαμβος</span>, =
			Lat. <i>ovatio</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				5.47
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐαστής</span>).</div>
